---
kind: lore
id: lore.guardians
title: The palace guardians
---

<entry id="eelFirst" on="bossDefeated" target="foe.eel" category="bark" title="The Long Eel" priority="10" once="user">
  @narrator: The Long Eel slides off the flagstones and out through a window that has not held glass in three hundred years.
  @ilo{mono}: It kept the hall. Now the hall is mine.
</entry>

<entry id="choirFirst" on="bossDefeated" target="foe.choir" category="bark" title="The Drowned Choir" priority="10" once="user">
  @narrator: The choir's last note hangs in the water after the singers are gone.
  @ilo{mono}: I know that song. Mother sang it. Why do I know that song?
</entry>
/* A guardian that falls again gets one bark a dive, whichever it is; each
first kill above (and the Regent's own scene) outranks it. */
<entry id="guardianAgain" on="bossDefeated" target="kind:foe" category="bark" once="run">
  <match on="occasion.target">
    <when is="eel">
      @narrator: The eel again. It never learns, and neither does he.
    </when>
    <when is="choir">
      @narrator: The choir falls silent, for now.
    </when>
    <when is="archivist">
      @archivist{emotion="grim"}: You have been catalogued before. I will file you again.
    </when>
    <when is="regent">
      @regent: Again, little heir? The throne is patient.
    </when>
  </match>
</entry>
/* The fallback bark for any guardian: the repeat bark plays once per dive,
so a second repeat kill in one dive (the eel on the way back up) gets this
one. */
<entry id="anyGuardian" on="bossDefeated" target="kind:foe" category="bark" priority="-5">
  @narrator: Ilo watches {{occasion.target}} sink out of sight. It will be back.
</entry>
